  "hypothesis": "The 2023 F regime break is visible row-locally because exact-C remains near the old regime while official current-season and previous-game rates move to the new regime. A strongly regularized, low-dimensional logistic probability model can learn this disagreement without the variance and extrapolation failure of the prior 40-plus-feature CatBoost F specialist.",
